                      "fill": "$text",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "1. Focus the URL input and type the full response-headers endpoint.\n2. Do not press Enter, Tab, blur, Add, or invoke submit-time backfill.\n3. Click the real Send control; verify 200 OK and Body is the default response tab.\n4. Click Headers and inspect the returned rows.\n5. Return to Body, then Tab → Headers and Enter / Space → activate.\n6. Switch back to Body; do not resend or mutate any product state.",
