                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• X-E2E-Header=visible and Content-Type=application/json render from ResponseState.\n• Header names compare case-insensitively; values compare exactly.\n• Repeated headers remain separate observable rows in arrival order.\n• An empty header collection renders “No response headers”.\n• Mouse and keyboard activate the same Headers view.\n• ResponseState, rendered response, request, active tab, and History remain unchanged after pane switching.",
